sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Homepage
    participant Restaurant
    participant FilterSearch
    participant Restaurant
    participant Review
    participant Favorites
    participant CultureStory
    participant UserProfile

    User ->> Homepage: Visit homepage
    Homepage -->> User: Display welcome message / featured content

    User ->> Restaurant: Browse restaurants
    Restaurant -->> User: Show paginated list

    User ->> FilterSearch: Apply filters/search query
    FilterSearch -->> Restaurant: Update list with filtered results

    User ->> Restaurant: Click on a restaurant
    Restaurant -->> User: Show detailed view (menu, location, etc.)

    User ->> Review: Submit rating/review
    Review -->> User: Confirm submission

    User ->> Favorites: Add to favorites
    Favorites -->> User: Confirmation or error

    User ->> CultureStory: View cultural food story
    CultureStory -->> User: Display origin/story/summary

    User ->> UserProfile: Open profile
    UserProfile -->> User: Show account info, reviews, favorites

    User ->> Homepage: Return or exit

    sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Homepage
    participant Restaurant
    participant FilterEngine
    participant ContentPanel
    participant ActionHandler
    participant ErrorHandler
    participant CulturalEngine
    participant UserProfile

    User ->> Homepage: Open homepage
    Homepage -->> User: Show landing view

    User ->> Restaurant: Browse restaurant list
    Restaurant ->> Restaurant: Load restaurant data
    alt Data loading failed / No data
        Restaurant ->> ErrorHandler: Trigger retry or no-data message
        ErrorHandler -->> User: Show retry or "No restaurants found"
    end

    User ->> FilterEngine: Apply filters/search
    alt No results or Error
        FilterEngine ->> ErrorHandler: Show "No results" / Retry
        ErrorHandler -->> User: Show message or retry
    end
    FilterEngine ->> Restaurant: Return filtered list

    User ->> Restaurant: Select a restaurant
    Restaurant -->> User: Display details

    User ->> ContentPanel: View ratings, reviews, stories
    ContentPanel -->> User: Show reviews, cultural story, recommendations

    User ->> ActionHandler: Rate / Review / Favorite
    alt Already rated/favorited or Not logged in
        ActionHandler ->> ErrorHandler: Check duplicates or auth
        ErrorHandler -->> User: Show "Already done" or "Login required"
    else Valid action
        ActionHandler ->> User: Confirm action success
    end

    User ->> CulturalEngine: Explore routes or similar recommendations
    CulturalEngine -->> User: Display cultural food journey

    User ->> UserProfile: Visit profile
    UserProfile -->> User: Manage history and favorites

    User ->> Homepage: Back to homepage or logout

